a-nimg="1" class="inline-block" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Feye-open.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Feye-open.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Feye-open.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/> Take a look inside</button></div><div class="space-y-4 lg:max-w-[48%] lg:ml-auto"><header class="space-y-4 "><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-[42px]">Dandy Presents: Desperate Dan by Jamie Smart Vol. 1 &amp; 2</h1><p class="leading-6">Enjoy free delivery (and lots of laughs) when you get both volumes!</p></header><div class="gap-y-4 wp-content-product-page-description"><p>Get ready for the ultimate Desperate Dan collection, bringing together volumes 1 and 2 of Jamie Smart’s brilliantly bonkers take on the world’s strongest cowboy. Packed with slapstick, surreal humour and wild western chaos, this two‑bookazine set delivers double the laughs – with free delivery.</p>
<p>Whether you’re discovering Desperate Dan for the first time or building a must‑have comic collection, this two‑volume set is the perfect way to experience one of Britain’s funniest cowboys.</p>
<p>Double the books. Double the laughs. Free delivery included.</p>
</div></div><div class="col-span-2 mt-8 md:mt-0 lg:mt-8 lg:max-w-[48%] lg:ml-auto space-y-8"><div class="product-variant-card border border-solid md:border-grey-200 rounded-lg shadow-lg overflow-hidden px-4 lg:px-6 py-6"><h2 class="hidden">Pricing</h2><div class="md:flex md:flex-row md:justify-between"><div><p><span class="product-variant-initial-price font-bold text-3xl leading-[54px]">£17.00</span></p><ul class="mb-6 md:mb-0 ml-6 list-image-[url(&#x27;../../public/sellpoint-check.svg&#x27;)] space-y-1"><li class="pl-1 leading-6 text-base text-blue-grey-700">Free delivery</li></ul></div><div class="space-y-3 min-w-[209px] shrink-0 grow-0"><button id="prodvar-sub-btn" class="bg-blue hover:bg-blue/90 active:bg-blue/90 rounded-lg font-[700] text-center text-white p-3 shadow-lg w-full transition-colors" aria-label="Buy &#x27;Dandy Presents: Desperate Dan by Jamie Smart Vol. 1 &amp; 2&#x27;">Buy Now</button><div class="mx-auto max-w-[180px] md:max-w-full flex justify-center items-center font-bold text-sm text-blue-grey-700 space-x-4"><img alt="Visa" loading="lazy" width="30" height="13" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fvisa.4ac894f7.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fvisa.4ac894f7.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fvisa.4ac894f7.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><img alt="Mastercard" loading="lazy" width="22" height="17" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmastercard.c3d8b337.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmastercard.c3d8b337.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmastercard.c3d8b337.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></form></div><div class="flex flex-col" style="width:100%"><div class="w-full dc-thomson-shop"><div class="mx-auto flex justify-