":\"Beano \u0026 The Dandy Annuals \u0026 Specials\",\"slug\":\"beano-dandy-comic-specials\",\"description\":\"\u003cp\u003eBrowse our latest seasonal specials and new releases from Beano and The Dandy.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\",\"shortDescription\":\"Unmissable specials from Beano and The Dandy.\",\"linkedCategories\":[],\"promoBanner\":null,\"metaDescription\":\"Browse our latest seasonal specials and new releases from Beano and The Dandy. Featuring summer special 2024s and a new release from The Bash Street Kids.\",\"metaKeywords\":\"\",\"metaRobots\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"Beano \u0026 The Dandy Comic Specials \u0026 Bookazines\"},\"product\":{\"id\":2133,\"brandId\":22,\"categoryId\":53,\"internalName\":\"Dandy Presents: Desperate Dan by Jamie Smart Vol. 1 \u0026 2\",\"displayName\":\"Dandy Presents: Desperate Dan by Jamie Smart Vol. 1 \u0026 2\",\"sortOrder\":3,\"displayPrice\":\"£17.00\",\"displayDiscountPercentage\":0,\"description\":\"\u003cp\u003eGet ready for the ultimate Desperate Dan collection, bringing together volumes 1 and 2 of Jamie Smart’s brilliantly bonkers take on the world’s strongest cowboy. Packed with slapstick, surreal humour and wild western chaos, this two‑bookazine set delivers double the laughs – with free delivery.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re discovering Desperate Dan for the first time or building a must‑have comic collection, this two‑volume set is the perfect way to experience one of Britain’s funniest cowboys.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eDouble the books. Double the laughs. Free delivery included.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\",\"shortDescription\":\"Enjoy free delivery (and lots of laughs) when you get both volumes!\",\"benefits\":[{\"benefit\":\"From the million-selling creator Jamie Smart\",\"benefitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Writers.png\"},{\"benefit\":\"Some of the funniest, wackiest and silliest Desperate Dan strips\",\"benefitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Desperate-Dan.png\"},{\"benefit\":\"Classic meets modern — Dan’s timeless charm with a 21st-century twist\",\"benefitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Beano-comic-pages.png\"},{\"benefit\":\"Free delivery when you buy both volumes\",\"benefitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Free-UK-delivery-03.png\"},{\"benefit\":\"Screen-free entertainment for the whole family\",\"benefitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Screen-free-entertainment.png\"},{\"benefit\":\"Perfect way to encourage reading\",\"benefitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Encourage-reading.png\"}],\"additionalBenefits\":[{\"heading\":\"Two 68-page\",\"label\":\"bookazines \",\"icon\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Beano-comic-pages.png\"},{\"heading\":\"Only available\",\"label\":\"delivery within the UK\",\"icon\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Free-UK-delivery-03.png\"},{\"heading\":\"Delivery within\",\"label\":\"5 to 7 working days\",\"icon\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Delivered-Weekly.png\"}],\"features\":[{\"title\":\"More information\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct code:\u003c/strong\u003e DANJS2\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eTwo 68-page bookazines, softback\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"How long with it take for my annual/bookazine/calendar to arrive?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eMost of our products are delivered within 5-7 working days, unless stated otherwise on the product page.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Can I add a gift message to a product order?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eUnfortunately, it is not possible to add gift messages to orders for annuals, bookazines or calendars.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Can I send my order as a gift to the recipient’s address?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYou can send an order to an address which is different from the billing address.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"I would like to cancel my product order, how can I do this?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eTo cancel your order, please contact our Customer Service team by filling out our \u003ca href=\\\"https://help.dcthomson.co.uk/contact-us\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eContact Us form\u003c/a\u003e, and we’ll respond as soon as possible.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"Can I order an annual/bookazine/calendar to an address outside of the UK?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eIt is not possible to order an annual, bookazine or calendar for delivery to an address outside of the UK.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"},{\"question\":\"How do I return a product that is incorrect/damaged?\",\"answer\":\"\u003cp\u003eYou can return a product by \u003ca href=\\\"https://help.dcthomson.co.uk/contact-us\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003econtacting our Customer Service team.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"}],\"images\":[\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dandy-Preesnts-Desperate-Dan-by-Jamie-Smart-pack.png\"],\"portraitImage\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dandy-Preesnts-Desperate-Dan-by-Jamie-Smart-pack-white.png\",\"previewFile\":\"https://cms.dcthomsonshop.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Dandy-Summer-Special-Flipbook.pdf\",\"goLiveDate\":\"$D2026-04-30T00:00:00.000Z\",\"expirationDate\":null,\"modified\":\"$D2026-04-30T12:05:46.000Z\",\"slug\":\"dandy-presents-desperate-dan-by-jamie-smart-vol-1-2\",\"metaDescription\":\"This bundle brings together both volumes of Dandy Presents: Desperate Dan by bestselling comic creator Jamie Smart \",\"metaKeywords\":\"\",\"metaRobots\":\"\",\"metaTitle\":\"Dandy Presents: Desperate Dan by Jamie Smart Vol. 1 \u0026 2\",\"metaCanonicalUrl\":\"\",\"productNewsletterCode\":\"\",\"redirectUrl\":null,\"benefitsHeading\":null,\"showPromoCodes\":false,\"issues\":[],\"trustpilotR